{"mod_id": "tfm2_level_cap", "name": "Champion Level Cap 18", "author": "tfm2mods", "version": "2.2.0", "last_updated": "2026-11-25", "description": "Raises the maximum champion level in matches from 12 to 18 (configurable).\n\nExperience needed up to level 12 stays exactly as in the base game; only levels 13 and above are added. Stats keep growing per level the same way the base game does, so higher levels mean stronger champions.\n\nSettings: tfm2_level_cap.cfg in the mod folder (restart the game after editing).\n* Line 1 = maximum level (2-500, default 18).\n* Line 2 = experience needed for each level from 12->13 upward, comma-separated (default 2700,3000,3300,3600,3900,4200). If there are fewer values than needed, the last one is reused.\n* 12 and 0 = same as vanilla.\n\nVery high caps keep adding stats and can break match balance; around 18-20 is recommended.\n\nBuilt for game 0.7.4. The mod patches the game's own code, so it is rebuilt for each game update; on any other game version the game disables it. Code mod (native DLL, Windows only).", "dependencies": [{"mod_id": "base", "version": ">=0.7.4, <0.7.5"}]}